title: "Bash WP-CLI Update"
abstract: >-
  Fleet maintenance for WordPress installations through WP-CLI: core, plugin and theme
  updates, database repair and optimisation, a database dump before anything changes, a
  restore path and JSON reports, driven by one bash script that runs as root.
